{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(does) not"}, {"text": "يَظْلِمُ", "translation": "wrong"}, {"text": "مِثْقَالَ", "translation": "(as much as) weight"}, {"text": "ذَرَّةٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "(of) an atom"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "تَكُ", "translation": "there is"}, {"text": "حَسَنَةًۭ", "translation": "a good"}, {"text": "يُضَـٰعِفْهَا", "translation": "He doubles it"}, {"text": "وَيُؤْتِ", "translation": "and gives"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "لَّدُنْهُ", "translation": "near Him"}, {"text": "أَجْرًا", "translation": "a reward"}, {"text": "عَظِيمًۭا", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "Indeed, Allāh does not do injustice, [even] as much as an atom's weight; while if there is a good deed, He multiplies it and gives from Himself a great reward."}